    <Major></Major>
    <Description>script for the mp7 in R6. Works for bandit only.
Disclaimer: DOES NOT WORK ON ZERO
zero mp7 has different recoil
dpi and sensitivity doesnt matter since there is very little recoil, but the screen resolution and aspect ratio does matter.

2560 x 1440 screen resolution

16:10 ratio

900dpi
sensitivity: 17

attachments: 
extended barrel
</Description>
    <Comment>script for the mp7 in R6. Works for bandit only.
